{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/216923-idigam-chronicle-pack-aspirations","id":216923,"title":"[Idigam Chronicle?] Pack Aspirations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-02T14:23:44-07:00","id":216923,"title":"[Idigam Chronicle?] Pack Aspirations","content":"So I run a 3 months now a Werewolf game on GMC rules. My players get about 1-3 Beats per session and I start to question is the new Aspieration system is good for the werewolves character, with it's all aim to devide a bit group as it is. Maybe something like one Pack Aspiration would be more in spirit of Uratha cooperation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T14:33:19-07:00","id":216938,"title":"","content":"Well you could add one, but I feel personal aspirations add a lot for the players","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T15:07:52-07:00","id":216982,"title":"","content":"I have a problem with them not using personal part of Aspiration. But there is also cohesive problem with pack - I think that Pack Aspiration could at least guide a group in one direction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-02-2014, 07:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T15:57:09-07:00","id":217017,"title":"","content":"One to three? That's not much.<br /> They get one for appearing. So in some of these games people aren't doing any aspirations, not playing or resolving any conditions, taking dramatic failures for failures, risking harmony or anything? Not even role playing particularly well?<br /> <br /> Also, why bother having a separate set of pack aspirations when two or more players can just have the same aspirations?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-02T16:06:11-07:00","id":217022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/216923-idigam-chronicle-pack-aspirations?p=217017#post217017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One to three? That's not much.<br /> They get one for appearing. So in some of these games people aren't doing any aspirations, not playing or resolving any conditions, taking dramatic failures for failures, risking harmony or anything? Not even role playing particularly well?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, pretty much this. I also give 1 Beat for playing Virtue or Vice, two for them both. Still, most characters get two Beats per game. I run group based on three young players ( Middle School, first &quot;serious&quot; game ), and two others veteran. Still players don't explore they options, even if I try to mark them after each game session. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/216923-idigam-chronicle-pack-aspirations?p=217017#post217017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, why bother having a separate set of pack aspirations when two or more players can just have the same aspirations?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because it's not the same as whole five having one goal. When Ed, Beth or even Rick can have things like &quot;Exploring the Verge&quot;, it's diffrent if the whole Pack having &quot;Getting sacrifice for All Father Thunder&quot; or even &quot;Getting the Locus&quot;.<br /> <br /> Especially, as in today game we had a &quot;ruling crisis&quot; when whole pack was againts idea putted by their Alpha.<br /> <br /> I don't say those confrontation shouldn't come to light, but unifying &quot;quest&quot; could makes general game direction more clear for players also.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T10:06:46-07:00","id":217485,"title":"","content":"I feel like the situation is some how getting over complicated. Perhaps try setting up a scenario for your players that makes them want a common goal. Instead of forcing them to it, make them come to that decision themselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T16:54:30-07:00","id":217640,"title":"","content":"For what it's worth, it does seem like they might have Pack Aspirations, or at least things a pack can do together to gain beats (sacred hunt, totem and pack stuff), but it doesn't seem like their presence would affect the beats going on in your game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}